[01:09.61]Ooh now I don't know you anymore 我竟已不认识 如今这陌生的你
[01:12.98]
[01:13.16]It's always hard to say goodbye 和你深爱的人诀别
[01:16.90]To the one person that's on your mind 诚然艰难
[01:20.90]But I can't waste my time trying to make you see 但我无法再浪费一分一秒 来让你知道
[01:25.02]You can't take back another lie 出口的谎言覆水难收
[01:27.95]
[01:28.99]You broke your promise to me long ago 许久之前 你便已经违背了诺言
[01:32.91]Although I tried my best to believe 尽管我已经为你赌上了一切
[01:37.09]Said your sorry ways would disappear 你说你表达抱歉的方式总是徒劳无功
[01:41.19]But now it's time for me to leave 但现在 我也该独自离开了
